<title>USA: Quigley buys exclusive patent license.</title>
<headline>Quigley buys exclusive patent license.</headline>
<dateline>DOYLESTOWN, Pa. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quigley Corp said on Tuesday it acquired an exclusive license for a zinc gluconate use patent from George Eby of George Eby Research for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>This use patent allows the company to continue manufacturing and marketing their proprietary zinc gluconate lozenges, Quigley said.</p>
<p>The company said the patent license also resolves a dispute among the competing patent holders and gives Quigley exclusive manufacturing and marketing rights to all proprietary zinc gluconate-based cold relief formulations.</p>
</text>
